    "questionEnglish": "Walk me through your professional journey.",
    "tags": [
     "Professional Introduction & Career"
    ],
    "answerEnglish": "My professional journey started with a foundation in visual arts and creative design. I initially worked in creative and digital production environments, where I gained experience in visual communication, animation and multimedia.\n\nAs technology and digital products evolved, I gradually moved towards interactive experiences and user interface design. I developed my understanding of usability, information architecture, interaction design and user-centred design.\n\nI later completed my Master of Design at IIT Bombay, which strengthened my design thinking, storytelling and problem-solving approach.\n\nOver time, I moved into digital product design and worked with organisations such as Cordys Software, Adeon Media Technologies and Openplay Technologies.\n\nAt Openplay, I worked on the Classic Rummy product, which gave me valuable experience in gaming UX, mobile product experiences and cross-functional collaboration.\n\nIn February 2025, I started D’SARAS Design Studio to independently work on product design consulting and build my own design initiatives.\n\nToday, I bring together my experience in visual design, UX strategy, digital products, leadership and emerging AI technologies.",
    "answerTelugu": "నా కెరీర్ Visual Arts మరియు Creative Design తో ప్రారంభమైంది. మొదట Animation, Multimedia, Visual Communication రంగాల్లో పనిచేశాను.\n\nతర్వాత Technology అభివృద్ధి చెందడంతో Interactive Design, UI Design, UX Design వైపు నా ప్రయాణం కొనసాగింది.\n\nIIT Bombay లో Master of Design పూర్తి చేసిన తర్వాత Product Design, UX Strategy, Interaction Design రంగాల్లో నా పరిజ్ఞానం మరింత పెరిగింది.\n\nCordys Software, Adeon Media Technologies, Openplay Technologies వంటి సంస్థల్లో పనిచేశాను. తర్వాత D’SARAS Design Studio ప్రారంభించాను.\n\nఇప్పుడు నా Creative Background, UX Experience, Product Thinking మరియు AI Knowledge అన్నింటినీ కలిపి డిజైన్ పరిష్కారాలను అందిస్తున్నాను.",
    "questionTelugu": "మీ ప్రొఫెషనల్ ప్రయాణాన్ని దశలవారీగా వివరించండి.",
    "exampleEnglish": "Tell it as three chapters: (1) Creative foundation – illustration, animation and multimedia; (2) Digital products – IIT Bombay, then Cordys, Adeon and Openplay with Classic Rummy; (3) Ownership – D'SARAS Design Studio and Design Acharya. One line per chapter keeps the story clear.",
    "exampleTelugu": "మూడు అధ్యాయాలుగా చెప్పండి: (1) Creative పునాది – Illustration, Animation, Multimedia; (2) Digital Products – IIT Bombay, తర్వాత Cordys, Adeon, Openplay లో Classic Rummy; (3) Ownership – D'SARAS Design Studio, Design Acharya. ప్రతి అధ్యాయానికి ఒక వాక్యం చెబితే కథ స్పష్టంగా ఉంటుంది.",
