    "questionEnglish": "What are your biggest professional strengths?",
    "tags": [
     "Professional Introduction & Career"
    ],
    "answerEnglish": "My first strength is my multidisciplinary design background. I can connect visual design, interaction design and product thinking.\n\nMy second strength is problem-solving. I try to understand the actual user problem before jumping into visual solutions.\n\nMy third strength is collaboration. I believe good products are created when design, product, engineering and business teams work together.\n\nMy fourth strength is leadership and mentoring. I enjoy helping designers improve their skills and make stronger design decisions.\n\nFinally, I am adaptable and continuously learning. I actively explore AI tools and emerging technologies to improve my design process.",
    "answerTelugu": "నా ప్రధాన బలాలు:\n\nవివిధ డిజైన్ రంగాల్లో అనుభవం.\n\nసమస్యను పూర్తిగా అర్థం చేసుకుని పరిష్కారం కనుగొనడం.\n\nProduct, Engineering, Business బృందాలతో కలిసి పనిచేయడం.\n\nడిజైనర్లకు మార్గదర్శకత్వం ఇవ్వడం.\n\nకొత్త టెక్నాలజీలు, ముఖ్యంగా AI నేర్చుకుంటూ ఉండటం.",
