    "questionEnglish": "Tell me about D’SARAS Design Studio.",
    "tags": [
     "D’SARAS Design Studio and Design Acharya"
    ],
    "answerEnglish": "D’SARAS Design Studio is my independent design venture, which I started in February 2025.\n\nThe studio focuses on digital product design, UX/UI consulting, branding and emerging AI-driven design solutions.\n\nMy vision is to bring together design strategy, technology and creativity to solve meaningful business and user problems.\n\nI am also exploring educational initiatives through Design Acharya, which focuses on making quality design learning and practical skills more accessible to aspiring designers.\n\nD’SARAS gives me the opportunity to take ownership of projects, explore new technologies and build long-term design initiatives.",
    "answerTelugu": "D’SARAS Design Studio ను ఫిబ్రవరి 2025 లో ప్రారంభించాను.\n\nఇది Digital Product Design, UX/UI Consulting, Branding మరియు AI-driven Design Solutions పై దృష్టి పెడుతుంది.\n\nDesign, Technology, Creativity కలిపి వినియోగదారులకు మరియు వ్యాపారాలకు ఉపయోగపడే పరిష్కారాలను అందించడం దీని ప్రధాన ఉద్దేశ్యం.",
    "questionTelugu": "D'SARAS Design Studio గురించి చెప్పండి.",
    "exampleEnglish": "A one-line pitch to practise: \"D'SARAS is a multi-wing creative studio – Design, Growth, Academy through Design Acharya, and Stories – bringing product design, AI-driven workflows and education under one roof.\"",
    "exampleTelugu": "ప్రాక్టీస్ చేయదగిన ఒక వాక్యం: \"D'SARAS అనేది Design, Growth, Design Acharya ద్వారా Academy, Stories అనే విభాగాలున్న Creative Studio – Product Design, AI-driven Workflows, Education ని ఒకే చోట అందిస్తుంది.\"",
